<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<GameData>
  <LocalizedText>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_ARCHIVE_STATUS" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>附庸身份（系统记录）</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_ARCHIVE_STATUS" Language="en_US"><Text>Archived identity (system record)</Text></Row>
    <!-- Simplified Chinese -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OBSERVATION_ONLY_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>终局观测模式</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OBSERVATION_ONLY_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>只记录文明实力、灭国比例和觉醒候选。完整实力比较需开启“单人实力统计”。开启观测时不执行附庸演练、城市转移、实验加成或宣战。默认开启。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_API_PROBE_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>附庸接口诊断</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_API_PROBE_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>记录文明状态及城市、玩家和胜利相关接口。开局尚未建城时，会在后续回合补查城市，最多四次。仅记录信息，不移交城市、删除单位或修改胜利规则。默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_WAR_OBSERVATION_TEST_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>战争战果观测</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_WAR_OBSERVATION_TEST_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>需开启终局观测模式。记录战争开始、结束和城市被攻占的证据，每次只检查有限数量的文明组合。不会宣战、移交城市或发出附庸请求，默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_PLAYER_CONSENT_TEST_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>玩家附庸确认演练</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_PLAYER_CONSENT_TEST_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>需关闭终局观测模式。在单人局向玩家发出一次演练请求，测试接受、拒绝和稍后决定。只记录选择，不移交城市或处理军队，默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_METRIC_BRIDGE_TEST_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>单人实力统计</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_METRIC_BRIDGE_TEST_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>为终局观测、附庸演练和资格观测提供完整的军力、科技、文化和经济统计。仅限单人局；不转移城市或改变产出，默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_ELIGIBILITY_OBSERVATION_TEST_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>附庸资格观测</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_ELIGIBILITY_OBSERVATION_TEST_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>需同时开启单人实力统计与终局观测模式。记录实力差距、战争证据和保护状态是否满足附庸门槛；信息不完整时不判定符合资格。不会发出请求或移交城市，默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_DEBUG_TIMING_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>终局性能计时</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_DEBUG_TIMING_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>将实力统计、战争组合采样和附庸资格观测的耗时与检查数量写入日志，便于检查回合性能。默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_TITLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>附庸请求演练</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_BODY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>{1} 提出附庸请求。此演练只记录你的决定，不改变城市或军队。请求将在第 {2} 回合到期。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_ACCEPT" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>接受演练请求</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_REJECT" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>拒绝</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_LATER" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>稍后决定</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_SHADOW_VASSAL_TEST_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>影子附庸演练</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_SHADOW_VASSAL_TEST_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>需关闭终局观测模式；完整实力比较请开启“单人实力统计”。为强弱电脑文明建立模拟附庸档案，演练自治度、项目选择和读档恢复；不转移城市或删除军队。默认关闭，实际产出效果由附庸项目加成实验另行控制。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_SHADOW_VASSAL_LIMIT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>影子附庸数量上限</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_SHADOW_VASSAL_LIMIT_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>影子附庸演练最多同时建立的电脑附庸档案数，默认 1。只对模拟档案生效，不会据此移交城市。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_PROJECT_EFFECTS_TEST_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>附庸项目加成实验</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_PROJECT_EFFECTS_TEST_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>需关闭终局观测模式，并有影子附庸项目完成。按军事、经济、科技或文化方向支持或削弱宗主；每种效果在同一宗主下最多累计 3 次，达到上限后仍结算自治度。旧实验局中无法计数的加成会暂停追加。默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_DRY_RUN_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>觉醒流程演练</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_DRY_RUN_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>需关闭终局观测模式。记录觉醒触发、候选及准备、征服、决战阶段的推进，不宣战、不添加加成或改变胜利。可独立开启演练，默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ACTIONS_TEST_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>觉醒战争与加成实验</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ACTIONS_TEST_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>仅限单人局：需启用觉醒终局，关闭终局观测模式与觉醒流程演练。准备期增强产能、粮食与军队生产，征服期再增强黄金收益，决战期再增强科技与文化；不直接增加部队战斗力。征服期向未受保护的电脑文明宣战，决战期向玩家宣战。默认关闭；决战前限制觉醒AI胜利，决战解除限制。真实附庸需另开真实模式。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_PREP_TURNS_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>觉醒准备期回合数</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_PREP_TURNS_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>标准速度下从觉醒触发到进入征服期的准备时间，默认 20 回合。新觉醒记录会按游戏速度调整。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_CONQUEST_TURNS_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>觉醒征服期回合数</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_CONQUEST_TURNS_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>标准速度下从征服期开始到进入决战期的时间，默认 50 回合。新觉醒记录会按游戏速度调整。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ENABLED_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>启用觉醒终局</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ENABLED_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>允许达到门槛后出现觉醒候选。实际战争和加成还需开启觉醒战争与加成实验，并关闭终局观测模式与觉醒流程演练。默认关闭。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_MIN_TURN_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>觉醒最早触发回合</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_MIN_TURN_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>按标准速度设置最早触发回合，默认 120；实际回合随游戏速度缩放（史诗 180、马拉松 360）。到达后仍需满足时代或灭国比例门槛。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ERA_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>觉醒触发时代</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ERA_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>默认工业时代。满足最早触发回合后，文明达到此时代或达到设定灭国比例，即满足觉醒触发门槛。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_DEAD_PERCENT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>觉醒灭国比例（%）</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_DEAD_PERCENT_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>按开局主要文明总数计算灭国比例，默认 30%。满足最早触发回合后，达到此比例或设定时代，即满足觉醒触发门槛。</Text>
    </Row>
    <!-- English fallback -->
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OBSERVATION_ONLY_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Endgame Observation Mode</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OBSERVATION_ONLY_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Records civilization strength, collapse percentage and awakening candidates. Complete strength comparisons require Single-Player Strength Statistics. Observation blocks vassal rehearsals, city transfers, experimental bonuses and declarations of war. Enabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_API_PROBE_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Vassal Interface Diagnostics</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_API_PROBE_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Logs civilization status and city, player and victory interfaces. If no cities exist at startup, checks city objects again on later samples, up to four times. Records information without transferring cities, deleting units or changing victory rules. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_WAR_OBSERVATION_TEST_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>War Outcome Observation</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_WAR_OBSERVATION_TEST_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Requires Endgame Observation Mode. Records wars, peace and captured-city evidence, checking a limited number of civilization pairs per sample. Does not declare wars, transfer cities or send vassal requests. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_PLAYER_CONSENT_TEST_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Player Vassal Consent Rehearsal</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_PLAYER_CONSENT_TEST_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Requires Endgame Observation Mode to be disabled. Sends one rehearsal request in a single-player game to test accepting, rejecting or deferring. Records the choice without transferring cities or handling armies. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_METRIC_BRIDGE_TEST_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Single-Player Strength Statistics</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_METRIC_BRIDGE_TEST_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Provides complete military, science, culture and economy statistics for endgame observation, vassal rehearsals and eligibility observation. Single-player only; does not transfer cities or change yields. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_ELIGIBILITY_OBSERVATION_TEST_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Vassal Eligibility Observation</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_ELIGIBILITY_OBSERVATION_TEST_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Requires Single-Player Strength Statistics and Endgame Observation Mode. Records whether strength gaps, war evidence and protection status meet vassal thresholds. Incomplete information blocks eligibility. Does not send requests or transfer cities. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_DEBUG_TIMING_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Endgame Performance Timing</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_DEBUG_TIMING_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Logs time and object counts for strength statistics, war-pair sampling and vassal eligibility observation to inspect turn performance. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_TITLE" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Vassal Request Rehearsal</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_BODY" Language="en_US">
      <Text>{1} proposes a vassal agreement. This rehearsal only records your decision; cities and armies remain unchanged. The request expires on turn {2}.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_ACCEPT" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Accept Rehearsal Request</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_REJECT" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Reject</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_CONSENT_LATER" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Decide Later</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_SHADOW_VASSAL_TEST_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Shadow Vassal Rehearsal</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_SHADOW_VASSAL_TEST_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Requires Endgame Observation Mode to be disabled. For complete strength comparisons, enable Single-Player Strength Statistics. Creates simulated vassal records for stronger and weaker AI civilizations to rehearse autonomy, projects and reload recovery. Does not transfer cities or delete armies. Disabled by default; actual yields are controlled separately by the project effects experiment.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_SHADOW_VASSAL_LIMIT_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Shadow Vassal Count Limit</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_SHADOW_VASSAL_LIMIT_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Maximum AI vassal records created by the shadow rehearsal at one time. Default: 1. Applies only to simulated records and does not transfer cities.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_PROJECT_EFFECTS_TEST_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Vassal Project Effects Experiment</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_PROJECT_EFFECTS_TEST_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Requires Endgame Observation Mode to be disabled and a completed shadow vassal project. Each military, economy, science or culture support or weakening effect can stack at most three times per overlord. Autonomy still advances at the cap. Uncounted effects from old experiments pause further attachments. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_DRY_RUN_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Awakening Process Rehearsal</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_DRY_RUN_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Requires Endgame Observation Mode to be disabled. Records awakening triggers, candidates and progression through preparation, conquest and showdown, without wars, bonuses or victory changes. Can be enabled independently for rehearsal. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ACTIONS_TEST_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Awakening War and Bonus Experiment</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ACTIONS_TEST_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Single-player only. Requires Enable Endgame Awakening, with observation and rehearsal disabled. Preparation boosts production, food and military unit production; conquest adds gold; showdown adds science and culture. Awakening never directly increases unit combat strength. Declares war on unprotected AI during conquest and on the player during showdown. Disabled by default. Awakening AI victory is locked until showdown. Real vassal transfers require Native Vassal Mode separately.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_PREP_TURNS_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Awakening Preparation Turns</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_PREP_TURNS_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Preparation time between awakening and conquest at Standard speed. Default: 20 turns. New awakening records scale the duration to game speed.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_CONQUEST_TURNS_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Awakening Conquest Turns</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_CONQUEST_TURNS_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Time between the start of conquest and showdown at Standard speed. Default: 50 turns. New awakening records scale the duration to game speed.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ENABLED_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Enable Endgame Awakening</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ENABLED_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Allows awakening candidates once thresholds are met. Actual wars and bonuses also require the war and bonus experiment, with observation and process rehearsal disabled. Disabled by default.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_MIN_TURN_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Earliest Awakening Turn</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_MIN_TURN_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Earliest trigger turn at Standard speed, scaled to the selected game speed. Default: Standard 120, Epic 180, Marathon 360. The era or civilization collapse threshold must also be met.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ERA_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Awakening Trigger Era</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_ERA_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Default: Industrial Era. After the earliest awakening turn, reaching this era or the configured civilization collapse percentage meets the awakening trigger threshold.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_DEAD_PERCENT_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Awakening Collapse Percentage</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_AWAKENING_DEAD_PERCENT_DESC" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Percentage of starting major civilizations that have been eliminated. Default: 30%. After the earliest awakening turn, meeting this percentage or the configured era meets the awakening trigger threshold.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_SHORT_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>附庸</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_TITLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>附庸与终局</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_TOOLTIP" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>查看附庸档案、自治项目和觉醒状态。当前为只读总览。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_CLOSE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>关闭总览</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_SUMMARY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>当前模式：{1}    单人实力统计：{2}[NEWLINE]觉醒状态：{3}</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_NOTICE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>影子附庸是演练档案，尚未接管城市；真实附庸与复国还未接通。这里只显示你已接触的文明。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_READ_ONLY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>只读总览 · 不发起城市移交、宣战或复国</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_NATIVE_PENDING" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>真实附庸与复国事务尚未接通；当前不会提交城市、单位或玩家变更。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_CANDIDATE_UNKNOWN" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>资格观察暂不可用</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_CANDIDATE_OBSERVED" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>附庸候选（仅观察）</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_CANDIDATE_INVALIDATED" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>附庸候选已失效</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_CANDIDATE_DETAILS" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>资格记录：{1}    层级：{2}[NEWLINE]最后采样：第{3}回合    样本：{4}</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_EMPTY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>当前没有已接触文明的附庸档案。观测模式不会自动建立档案；影子附庸需在新测试局单独开启演练。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_UNKNOWN" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>暂不可用</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_UNMET" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>尚未接触的文明</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_SUPPORT" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>支持宗主</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_WEAKEN" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>削弱宗主</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_MILITARY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>军事</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_ECONOMY" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>经济</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_SCIENCE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>科技</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_CULTURE" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>文化</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_GENERAL" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>综合</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_OVERVIEW_DETAILS" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
