    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_MODE_DESC" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>关闭观测模式并启用实力统计、资格与战争观察后接通真实事务。生产归档暂停，复国时恢复；不支持的生产恢复会在移交前阻止。仅单人独立测试局。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_MODE_DESC" Language="en_US"><Text>Enable actual transactions with observation off and metrics/eligibility/war tracking on. Production is archived until restoration. Unsupported restoration blocks transfer. Single-player test games only.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_CONSENT_TITLE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>附庸与复国确认</Text></Row>
