    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_ATTACH_BODY" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>{1} 提出真实附庸请求。接受后全部约定城市归宗主管理，你的单位将移除，原生产队列与产能归档暂停；文明身份保留，自治达标后复国恢复。第 {2} 回合到期。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_ATTACH_BODY" Language="en_US"><Text>{1} proposes vassalization. Your archived cities transfer and units are removed. Production is paused in the archive until autonomy permits restoration of your original civilization. Expires on turn {2}.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_RESTORE_BODY" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>对 {1} 的自治已达标。确认后归还档案城市、恢复首都及原生产队列与产能，重新独立。第 {2} 回合到期。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_RESTORE_BODY" Language="en_US"><Text>Autonomy under {1} is complete. Confirm to return archived cities, restore the capital and archived production, and become independent. Expires on turn {2}.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_ACCEPT" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>确认执行</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_ACCEPT" Language="en_US"><Text>Confirm</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_EC_NATIVE_OPERATION_NOTICE" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>真实附庸模式：提交时复核资格与保护。玩家请求需明确确认；结果不明则暂停。</Text></Row>
